### Finance Service (local mocked user alice / alice)
@auth = Basic alice:alice

### Dashboard key figures
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/finance/dashboard()
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Overdue invoices
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/finance/SupplierInvoices?$filter=status eq 'Overdue'&$expand=supplier($select=name)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Mark an invoice as paid
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/finance/SupplierInvoices(ID=22222222-0000-4000-8000-000000000009,IsActiveEntity=true)/FinanceService.markInvoicePaid
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
